3. ITU-T Recommendations T.4 and T.6

   src/tiff.zig implements the modified Huffman and modified modified READ
   codes of ITU-T T.4 and T.6 from the published Recommendations; the code
   tables are the standard's data. The coder's structure follows an earlier
   Group 4 coder by the same author, released here under the MIT License.

4. zignal (https://github.com/arrufat/zignal)

   src/png.zig follows the scheme of zignal's src/codecs/png.zig for the
   parallel IDAT: every row chunk is its own Deflate stream ended by a sync
   flush, the streams are concatenated into one zlib member and the Adler-32
   is combined from the chunks' checksums. The code is zigcv's own.

